   "rating": 8,
   "date": "2019-10-23T11:57:08-05:00",
   "body": "If you're looking at the comments on this recipe, plan, or quest you might be a collector or completionist. \nThis is a compiled list of all of the cross-faction recipes in the game.\n\nMost (not all) [skill=185] recipes on the Alliance side are sold by [npc=340]. The Horde do not have a corresponding NPC, so if you are an Alliance character wanting to create an alt on the opposite side to obtain the recipes for your main, unfortunately you'll have to have a level appropriate character to do the quests to obtain some of these recipes.\n\nAll of the recipes except one ([item=7994]) can be traded cross-faction on the neutral AH.\n\n\n[b]Alliance Only Recipes[/b]\n\n[table border=2]\n[tr][td][b]Item[/b][/td][td][b]Quest / Vendor[/b][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td] [/td][td] [/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][b][skill=164][/b][/td][td][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td] [/td][td] [/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=9367][/td][td][quest=2758][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=6735][/td][td][quest=1618][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td] [/td][td] [/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][b][skill=185][/b][/td][td][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=2889][/td][td][quest=384] / [npc=340][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=3679][/td][td][quest=418] / [npc=340][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=5528][/td][td][npc=4305] / [npc=4307][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=3681][/td][td][quest=471] /  [npc=340][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=3678][/td][td][quest=385] /  [npc=340][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=3683][/td][td][quest=93] /  [npc=340][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=2697][/td][td][quest=22] /  [npc=340][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=6329][/td][td][npc=1684][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=3680][/td][td][quest=127] /  [npc=340][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=2699][/td][td][quest=92] /  [npc=340][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=2701][/td][td][quest=90] /  [npc=340][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=3736][/td][td][quest=564][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=728][/td][td][quest=38] /  [npc=340][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td] [/td][td] [/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][b][skill=202][/b][/td][td][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=18649][/td][td][npc=5175] / [npc=1304][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td] [/td][td] [/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][b][skill=165][/b][/td][td][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=7289][/td][td][npc=2697][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=20576][/td][td][npc=777][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=7361][/td][td][npc=6731][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=6710][/td][td][quest=1582][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=13288][/td][td][npc=2816][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=7290][/td][td][npc=2679][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td] [/td][td] [/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][b][skill=197][/b][/td][td][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=14627][/td][td][npc=2668][/td][/tr]\n\n[/table]\n[br]\n[b]Horde Only Recipes[/b]\n\n[table border=2]\n[tr][td][b]Item[/b][/td][td][b]Quest / Vendor[/b][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td] [/td][td] [/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][b][skill=171][/b][/td][td] [/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=4597][/td][td][quest=429][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td] [/td][td] [/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][b][skill=164][/b][/td][td] [/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=7981][/td][td][quest=2753] (Blacksmithing 140)[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=7979][/td][td][quest=2751] (Blacksmithing 140)[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=7982][/td][td][quest=2755] (Blacksmithing 140)[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=7980][/td][td][quest=2754] (Blacksmithing 140)[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=7978][/td][td][quest=2752] (Blacksmithing 140)[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=7994]*[/td][td][quest=2756][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td] [/td][td] [/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][b][skill=185][/b][/td][td] [/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=12226][/td][td][npc=2118][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=5488][/td][td][npc=3482][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=5487][/td][td][quest=862][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=20075][/td][td][npc=4879][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=5484][/td][td][npc=3081][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=5483][/td][td][npc=3881] / [npc=5757][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td] [/td][td] [/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][b][skill=333][/b][/td][td] [/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=6346][/td][td][npc=3346][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td] [/td][td] [/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][b][skill=202][/b][/td][td] [/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=18647][/td][td][npc=3413][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][/td][td][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][b][skill=165][/b][/td][td] [/td][/tr]\n[tr][td][item=5083]